  <para style="rem">Revised with Jeffrey Oct 2012</para>
  <para style="rem">Revised in joint session with Stivin Piki Jan 2013, but did not complete all of it, especially not chapter 5 and the end fo chapter 4. All corrections entered and checked in VTP – 22 Jan 2013</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant checke by WB Feb 2015</para>
